msgctxt "ActionTransient:39168:0:0"
msgid "Delivers an attack to target and all enemies nearby it with a potency of 8,000 for the first enemy, and 4,000 for all remaining enemies.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Maximum Charges: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>2<br>This weaponskill does not share a recast timer with any other actions."
