msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 12,000 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Absorbs 100% of damage dealt as HP<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Reawakened</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Effect fades upon execution.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
