msgid "Paints a <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>pair of wings</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, granting <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Wing Motif</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Can only be cast while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Wing Sketch</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>The recast timer of this action is not affected by status effects.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
